#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MILKPRESS.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MILKPRESS.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Crushes organic materials to extract liquids such as <link=\"MILK\">Brackene</link> or <link=\"PHYTOOIL\">Phyto Oil</"
"link>.\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"MILK\">Brackene</link> can be used to refill the <link=\"MILKFEEDER\">Critter Fountain</link>."
msgstr ""
"Esmaga materiais orgânicos para extrair líquidos como <link=\"MILK\">Braquil</link> ou <link=\"PHYTOOIL\">Óleo Fito</"
"link>.\n"
"\n"
"<link=\"MILK\">Braquil</link> pode ser usado para reabastecer a <link=\"MILKFEEDER\">Fonte de Criaturas</link>."

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MILKPRESS.KELP_TO_PHYTO_OIL_RECIPE_DESCRIPTION
