#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSILEFABRICATOR.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSILEFABRICATOR.DESC"
msgid "Blastshot shells are an effective defense against incoming meteor showers."
msgstr "Projéteis de Tiro Explosivo são uma defesa eficaz contra chuvas de meteoros que se aproximam."

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSILEFABRICATOR.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSILEFABRICATOR.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Produces <link=\"MISSILELAUNCHER\">Blastshot</link> from <link=\"REFINEDMETAL\">Refined Metals</link> combined with "
"<link=\"PETROLEUM\">Petroleum</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Duplicants will not fabricate items unless recipes are queued."
msgstr ""
"Produz <link=\"MISSILELAUNCHER\">Tiro Explosivo</link> de <link=\"REFINEDMETAL\">Metais Refinados</link> combinados com "
"<link=\"PETROLEUM\">Petróleo</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Os Duplicantes não fabricarão itens a menos que as receitas estejam enfileiradas."

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSILEFABRICATOR.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSILEFABRICATOR.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MISSILEFABRICATOR\">Blastshot Maker</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MISSILEFABRICATOR\">Fabrica de Tiro Explosivo</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSILEFABRICATOR.RECIPE_DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSILEFABRICATOR.RECIPE_DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Produces {0} from {1} and {2}."
msgstr "Produz {0} de {1} e {2}."

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSILEFABRICATOR.RECIPE_DESCRIPTION_LONGRANGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSILEFABRICATOR.RECIPE_DESCRIPTION_LONGRANGE"
msgid "Produces {0} from {1}, {2}, and {3}."
msgstr "Produz {0} de {1}, {2} e {3}."

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSILELAUNCHER.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSILELAUNCHER.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Fires <link=\"MISSILELAUNCHER\">Blastshot</link> shells at meteor showers to defend the colony from impact-related damage.\n"
"\n"
"Range: 16 tiles horizontally, 32 tiles vertically.\n"
"\n"
"Meteors that have been blown to smithereens leave behind no harvestable resources."
msgstr ""
"Dispara projéteis de <link=\"MISSILELAUNCHER\">Tiro Explosivo</link> em chuvas de meteoros para defender a colônia de danos "
"relacionados ao impacto.\n"
"\n"
"Alcance: 16 blocos horizontalmente, 32 blocos verticalmente.\n"
"\n"
"Meteoros que foram explodidos em pedacinhos não deixam recursos coletáveis."

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSILELAUNCHER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSILELAUNCHER.DESC"
msgid "Some meteors drop harvestable resources when they're blown to smithereens."
msgstr "Alguns meteoros deixam cair recursos coletáveis quando são explodidos em pedacinhos."

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSILELAUNCHER.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSILELAUNCHER.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Fires explosive projectiles at incoming space objects to defend the colony from impact-related damage.\n"
"\n"
"Projectiles must be crafted at a <link=\"MISSILEFABRICATOR\">Blastshot Maker</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Range: 16 tiles horizontally, 32 tiles vertically."
msgstr ""
"Dispara projéteis explosivos contra objetos espaciais que se aproximam para defender a colônia de danos relacionados a "
"impactos.\n"
"\n"
"Projéteis devem ser criados em uma <link=\"MISSILEFABRICATOR\">Fábrica de Tiros</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Alcance: 16 blocos horizontalmente, 32 blocos verticalmente."

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSILELAUNCHER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSILELAUNCHER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MISSILELAUNCHER\">Meteor Blaster</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MISSILELAUNCHER\">Detonador de Meteoros</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSILELAUNCHER.TARGET_SELECTION_HEADER
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSILELAUNCHER.TARGET_SELECTION_HEADER"
msgid "Short Range Target Selection"
msgstr "Seleção de Alvo de Curto Alcance"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSILESETLOCKER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSILESETLOCKER.DESC"
msgid ""
"A locker that once belonged to an explosives engineer.\n"
"\n"
"It holds one <link=\"MISSILELAUNCHER\">Intracosmic Blastshot</link>."
msgstr ""
"Um armário que um dia pertenceu a um engenheiro de explosivos.\n"
"\n"
"Ele contém um <link=\"MISSILELAUNCHER\">Tiro Intracósmico</link>."

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSILESETLOCKER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSILESETLOCKER.NAME"
msgid "Explosives Locker"
msgstr "Armário de Explosivos"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSIONCONTROL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSIONCONTROL.DESC"
msgid "Like a backseat driver who actually does know better."
msgstr "Como um passageiro do banco de trás que realmente sabe mais."

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSIONCONTROL.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSIONCONTROL.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Provides guidance data to rocket pilots, to improve rocket speed.\n"
"\n"
"Must be operated by a Duplicant with the <link=\"ASTRONOMY\">Astronomy</link> skill.\n"
"\n"
"Requires a clear line of sight to space in order to function."
msgstr ""
"Fornece dados de orientação para pilotos de foguetes, para melhorar a velocidade do foguete.\n"
"\n"
"Deve ser operado por um Duplicante com a habilidade de <link=\"ASTRONOMY\">Astronomia</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Requer uma linha de visão clara para o espaço para funcionar."

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSIONCONTROL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSIONCONTROL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MISSIONCONTROL\">Mission Control Station</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MISSIONCONTROL\">Estação de Controle da Missão</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSIONCONTROLCLUSTER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSIONCONTROLCLUSTER.DESC"
msgid "Like a backseat driver who actually does know better."
msgstr "Como um motorista do banco de trás que realmente sabe mais."

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSIONCONTROLCLUSTER.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSIONCONTROLCLUSTER.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Provides guidance data to rocket pilots within range, to improve rocket speed.\n"
"\n"
"Must be operated by a Duplicant with the <link=\"ASTRONOMY\">Astronomy</link> skill.\n"
"\n"
"Requires a clear line of sight to space in order to function."
msgstr ""
"Fornece dados de orientação aos pilotos de foguetes dentro do alcance, para melhorar a velocidade do foguete.\n"
"\n"
"Deve ser operado por um Duplicante com a habilidade <link=\"ASTRONOMY\">Astronomia</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Requer linha de visão desobstruída para o espaço para funcionar."

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSIONCONTROLCLUSTER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MISSIONCONTROLCLUSTER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MISSIONCONTROLCLUSTER\">Mission Control Station</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MISSIONCONTROLCLUSTER\">Estação de Controle da Missão</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARGASINPUT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARGASINPUT.DESC"
msgid "A hub from which to input <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gas</link>."
msgstr "Uma central onde o <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gás</link> entra."

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARGASINPUT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARGASINPUT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MODULARGASINPUT\">Gas Input Hub</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MODULARGASINPUT\">Central de Entrada de Gases</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARLAUNCHPADPORT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARLAUNCHPADPORT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTSOLID\">Rocket Port</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTSOLID\">Porta de Foguete</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARLAUNCHPADPORT.NAME_PLURAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARLAUNCHPADPORT.NAME_PLURAL"
msgid "<link=\"MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTSOLID\">Rocket Ports</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTSOLID\">Portas de Foguete</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTBRIDGE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTBRIDGE.DESC"
msgid "Allows rocket platforms to be built farther apart."
msgstr "Permite que plataformas de foguetes sejam construídas mais distantes umas das outras."

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTBRIDGE.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTBRIDGE.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Automatically links when built to the side of a <link=\"LAUNCHPAD\">Rocket Platform</link> or any "
"<link=\"MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTSOLID\">Rocket Port</link>."
msgstr ""
"Conecta-se automaticamente quando construído ao lado de uma <link=\"LAUNCHPAD\">Plataforma de Foguete</link> ou qualquer "
"<link=\"MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTSOLID\">Porta de Foguete</link>."

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTBRIDGE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTBRIDGE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTBRIDGE\">Rocket Port Extension</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTBRIDGE\">Extensão da Porta de Foguete</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTGAS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTGAS.DESC"
msgid "Rockets must be landed to load or unload resources."
msgstr "Foguetes devem ser aterrissados para carregar ou descarregar recursos."

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTGAS.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTGAS.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Loads <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gases</link> to the storage of a linked rocket.\n"
"\n"
"Automatically links when built to the side of a <link=\"LAUNCHPAD\">Rocket Platform</link> or another "
"<link=\"MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTSOLID\">Rocket Port</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Uses the gas filters set on the rocket's cargo bays."
msgstr ""
"Carrega <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gases</link> para o armazenamento de um foguete conectado.\n"
"\n"
"Conecta-se automaticamente quando construído ao lado de uma <link=\"LAUNCHPAD\">Plataforma de Foguete</link> ou outra "
"<link=\"MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTSOLID\">Porta de Foguete</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Usa os filtros de gás definidos nos compartimentos de carga do foguete."

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTGAS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTGAS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTGAS\">Gas Rocket Port Loader</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTGAS\">Carregador de Porta de Foguete de Gás</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTGASUNLOADER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTGASUNLOADER.DESC"
msgid "Rockets must be landed to load or unload resources."
msgstr "Foguetes devem ser aterrissados para carregar ou descarregar recursos."

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTGASUNLOADER.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.MODULARLAUNCHPADPORTGASUNLOADER.EFFECT"
msgid ""
"Unloads <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gases</link> from the storage of a linked rocket.\n"
"\n"
