#. STRINGS.CODEX.ADVANCEDCURE.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ADVANCEDCURE.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"An extremely powerful medication created to treat severe <link=\"DISEASE\">Diseases</link>. <link=\"ADVANCEDCURE\">Serum "
"Vial</link> is very effective against <link=\"ZOMBIESPORES\">Zombie Spores</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Must be administered by a Duplicant with the <link=\"MEDICINE3\">Advanced Medical Care</link> Skill."
msgstr ""
"Um medicamento extremamente poderoso criado para tratar <link=\"DISEASE\">Doenças</link> graves. "
"<link=\"ADVANCEDCURE\">Frasco de Soro</link> é muito eficaz contra <link=\"ZOMBIESPORES\">Esporos Zumbi</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Deve ser administrado por um Duplicata com a Habilidade <link=\"MEDICINE3\">Cuidados Médicos Avançado</link>."

#. STRINGS.CODEX.ADVANCEDCURE.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ADVANCEDCURE.SUBTITLE"
