"    • <link=\"MISCELLANEOUSTIPS14\">Tutorial: Escala de Trabalho</link>\n"
"    • <link=\"MISCELLANEOUSTIPS10\">Tutorial: Germes e Doenças</link>\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.HEALTH.PARAGRAPH_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.HEALTH.PARAGRAPH_5"
msgid ""
"To learn more about supporting healthy Duplicant function, see:\n"
"    • <link=\"MISCELLANEOUSTIPS11\">Tutorial: Food Safety</link>\n"
"    • <link=\"MISCELLANEOUSTIPS20\">Tutorial: Powering Bionics</link>\n"
