"\n"
"<indent=35%>~ * ~</indent>\n"
"\n"
"</indent><indent=18%><i>Baby shower invitation to follow.</i></indent>\n"
"-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n"
"\n"
"Would you like me to file it with the others?"
msgstr ""
"Diretora, isto foi enviado para a caixa de entrada geral.\n"
"\n"
"-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n"
"<indent=35%>~ * ~</indent>\n"
"\n"
"<indent=12%>Cel. Josephine Carnot & Dr. Alan Stern</indent>\n"
"<indent=35%>e</indent>\n"
"<indent=12%>Dr. Kyung Min Wen & Dr. Soobin Chen</indent>\n"
"\n"
"<indent=20%><i>estão radiantes em anunciar\n"
"<indent=15%>a chegada de sua primeira neta</i></indent>\n"
"\n"
"<smallcaps><indent=20%><b><size=17>Giselle Jackie-Lin Stern</size></b></indent></smallcaps>\n"
"\n"
