#. STRINGS.CODEX.SNAIL.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SNAIL.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
"Slogos' unusually thick skin prevents them from succumbing to the fatal osmosis that other members of the Gastropoda class "
"experience after exposure to <link=\"SALT\">Salt</link>.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"A pele extraordinariamente grossa dos Lesmargos os impede de sucumbir à osmose fatal que outros membros da classe "
"Gastropoda experimentam após a exposição a <link=\"SALT\">Sal</link>.\n"
"\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.SNAIL.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SNAIL.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid "This enables them to safely enjoy the fluid retention properties of their preferred food."
msgstr "Isso lhes permite aproveitar com segurança as propriedades de retenção de fluidos de seu alimento preferido."

