#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GEYSER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.GEYSER.DESC"
msgid ""
"A highly pressurized geyser that periodically erupts, spraying <link=\"STEAM\">Steam</link> and boiling hot "
