#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.LIGHTBUG.VARIANT_RADIOACTIVE.BABY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.LIGHTBUG.VARIANT_RADIOACTIVE.BABY.DESC"
