msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.LIGHTBUG.VARIANT_RADIOACTIVE.DESC"
msgid ""
"Shine Bugs emit a dangerously radioactive <link=\"LIGHT\">Light</link> in hopes of attracting more of their kind for "
"company."
