#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SPACETREE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SPACETREE.DESC"
msgid ""
"Bonbon Tree branches synthesize <link=\"LIGHT\">Light</link> to produce <link=\"SUGARWATER\">Nectar</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Branches can be harvested for <link=\"WOOD\">Wood</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Bonbon Trees can shed most environmental debris, and rarely become entombed."
msgstr ""
"Árvores Docinhas sintetizam <link=\"LIGHT\">Luz</link> para produzir <link=\"SUGARWATER\">Néctar</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Seus galhos podem ser colhidos para obter <link=\"WOOD\">Madeira</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Árvores Docinhas podem eliminar a maioria dos detritos ambientais e raramente ficam soterradas."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SPACETREE.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SPACETREE.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant produces <link=\"SUGARWATER\">Nectar</link> and <link=\"WOOD\">Wood</link>."
msgstr "Essa planta produz <link=\"SUGARWATER\">Néctar</link> e <link=\"WOOD\">Madeira</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SPACETREE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SPACETREE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SPACETREE\">Bonbon Tree</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SPACETREE\">Árvore Docinha</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SPICE_VINE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SPICE_VINE.DESC"
msgid ""
"Pincha Pepperplants produce flavorful <link=\"SPICENUT\">Pincha Peppernut</link> for spicing <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link>."
msgstr ""
"Pimenteiras Baga produzem a saborosa <link=\"SPICENUT\">Pimenta Baga</link> ideal para temperar <link=\"FOOD\">Alimentos</"
"link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SPICE_VINE.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SPICE_VINE.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant produces <link=\"SPICENUT\">Pincha Peppernut</link> spices."
msgstr "Esta planta produz a especiaria <link=\"SPICENUT\">Pimenta Baga</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SPICE_VINE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SPICE_VINE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SPICEVINE\">Pincha Pepperplant</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SPICEVINE\">Pimenteira Baga</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUID.BABY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUID.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A rubbery little Glo Squid Larva.\n"
"\n"
"One day, it will grow into a radiant <link=\"SQUID\">Glo Squid</link>."
msgstr ""
"Uma pequena Larva de Lula gomosa.\n"
"\n"
"Um dia, ela crescerá e virará um <link=\"SQUID\">Luluzente</link> radiante."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUID.BABY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUID.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SQUID\">Glo Squid Larva</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SQUID\">Larva Luluzente</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUID.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUID.DESC"
msgid ""
"Glo Squids are nonhostile critters unless their eggs are nearby.\n"
"\n"
"They eat <link=\"TUBEWORM\">Tublia</link> and excrete <link=\"KATAIRITE\">Abyssalite</link> .\n"
"\n"
"They can be milked for <link=\"INK\">Squid Ink</link>."
msgstr ""
"Luluzentes são criaturas não hostis, a menos que seus ovos estejam por perto.\n"
"\n"
"Eles comem <link=\"TUBEWORM\">Tubélia</link> e excretam <link=\"KATAIRITE\">Abissalita</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Eles podem ser ordenhados para obter <link=\"INK\">Tinta de Lula</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUID.EGG_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUID.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SQUID\">Glo Squid Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SQUID\">Ovo de Luluzente</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUID.INK_PUNCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUID.INK_PUNCH"
msgid "Ink Shot"
msgstr "Tiro de Tinta"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUID.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUID.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SQUID\">Glo Squid</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SQUID\">Luluzente</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUIRREL.BABY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUIRREL.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A little purring Pipsqueak.\n"
"\n"
"In time it will mature into a fully grown <link=\"SQUIRREL\">Pip</link>."
msgstr ""
"Uma pequena Cutiazinha ronronante.\n"
"\n"
"Com o tempo, ela crescerá e se tornará uma <link=\"SQUIRREL\">Cutia</link> adulta."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUIRREL.BABY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUIRREL.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SQUIRREL\">Pipsqueak</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SQUIRREL\">Cutiazinha</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUIRREL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUIRREL.DESC"
msgid ""
"Pips are pesky, nonhostile critters that subsist on <link=\"BASICFABRICPLANT\">Thimble Reeds</link> and "
"<link=\"FORESTTREE\">Arbor Tree</link> branches.\n"
"\n"
"They are known to bury <link=\"PLANTS\">Seeds</link> in the ground whenever they can find a suitable area with enough space."
msgstr ""
"Cutias são criaturas irritantes, não hostis que subsistem de <link=\"BASICFABRICPLANT\">Junco</link> e de galhos de "
"<link=\"FORESTTREE\">Árvore Arbórea</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Eles são conhecidos por enterrar <link=\"PLANTS\">Sementes</link> no chão sempre que encontram uma área adequada com espaço "
"suficiente."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUIRREL.EGG_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUIRREL.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SQUIRREL\">Pip Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SQUIRREL\">Ovo de Cutia</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUIRREL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUIRREL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SQUIRREL\">Pip</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SQUIRREL\">Cutia</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUIRREL.VARIANT_HUG.BABY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUIRREL.VARIANT_HUG.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A fuzzy little Cuddle Pipsqueak.\n"
"\n"
"In time it will mature into a fully grown <link=\"SQUIRREL\">Cuddle Pip</link>."
msgstr ""
"Uma pequena e peludinha Cutiazinha Carinhosa.\n"
"\n"
"Com o tempo, ela se tornará uma <link=\"SQUIRREL\">Cutia Carinhosa</link> adulta."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUIRREL.VARIANT_HUG.BABY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUIRREL.VARIANT_HUG.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SQUIRREL\">Cuddle Pipsqueak</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SQUIRREL\">Cutiazinha Carinhosa</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUIRREL.VARIANT_HUG.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUIRREL.VARIANT_HUG.DESC"
msgid ""
"Cuddle Pips are fluffy, affectionate critters who exhibit a strong snuggling instinct towards all types of eggs.\n"
"\n"
"This is temporarily amplified when they are hugged by a passing Duplicant."
msgstr ""
"Cutias Carinhosas são criaturas fofas e afetuosas que exibem um forte instinto de abraço em relação a todos os tipos de "
"ovos.\n"
"\n"
"Isso é temporariamente amplificado quando elas são abraçadas por um Duplicante que passa."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUIRREL.VARIANT_HUG.EGG_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUIRREL.VARIANT_HUG.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SQUIRREL\">Cuddle Pip Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SQUIRREL\">Ovo de Cutia Carinhosa</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUIRREL.VARIANT_HUG.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SQUIRREL.VARIANT_HUG.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SQUIRREL\">Cuddle Pip</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SQUIRREL\">Cutia Carinhosa</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.BABY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A chubby little Plug Sluglet.\n"
"\n"
"In time it will mature into a fully grown <link=\"STATERPILLAR\">Plug Slug</link>."
msgstr ""
"Uma pequena Lesminha Elétrica rechonchuda.\n"
"\n"
"Com o tempo, ela amadurecerá e se tornará uma <link=\"STATERPILLAR\">Lesma Elétrica</link> totalmente crescida."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.BABY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"STATERPILLAR\">Plug Sluglet</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"STATERPILLAR\">Lesminha Elétrica</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.DESC"
msgid ""
"Plug Slugs are dynamic creatures that generate electrical <link=\"POWER\">Power</link> during the night.\n"
"\n"
"Their power can be harnessed by leaving an exposed wire near areas where they like to sleep."
msgstr ""
"Lesmas Elétricas são criaturas dinâmicas que geram <link=\"POWER\">Energia</link> elétrica durante a noite.\n"
"\n"
"Sua energia pode ser aproveitada deixando um cabo exposto perto de áreas onde elas gostam de dormir."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.EGG_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"STATERPILLAR\">Plug Slug Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"STATERPILLAR\">Ovo de Lesma Elétrica</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"STATERPILLAR\">Plug Slug</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"STATERPILLAR\">Lesma Elétrica</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.VARIANT_GAS.BABY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.VARIANT_GAS.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A tubby little Smog Sluglet.\n"
"\n"
"In time it will mature into a fully grown <link=\"STATERPILLAR\">Smog Slug</link>."
msgstr ""
"Uma pequena Lesminha Gasosa gordinha.\n"
"\n"
"Com o tempo, ela amadurecerá e se tornará uma <link=\"STATERPILLAR\">Lesma Gasosa</link> totalmente crescida."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.VARIANT_GAS.BABY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.VARIANT_GAS.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"STATERPILLAR\">Smog Sluglet</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"STATERPILLAR\">Lesminha Gasosa</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.VARIANT_GAS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.VARIANT_GAS.DESC"
msgid ""
"Smog Slugs are porous creatures that draw in unbreathable <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gases</link> during the day.\n"
"\n"
"At night, they sleep near exposed <link=\"GASCONDUIT\">Gas Pipes,</link> where they deposit their cache."
msgstr ""
"Lesmas Gasosas são criaturas porosas que absorvem <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gases</link> irrespiráveis durante o dia.\n"
"\n"
"À noite, elas dormem perto de <link=\"GASCONDUIT\">Tubos</link> expostos, onde depositam seu estoque."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.VARIANT_GAS.EGG_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.VARIANT_GAS.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"STATERPILLAR\">Smog Slug Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"STATERPILLAR\">Ovo de Lesma Gasosa</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.VARIANT_GAS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.VARIANT_GAS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"STATERPILLAR\">Smog Slug</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"STATERPILLAR\">Lesma Gasosa</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.VARIANT_LIQUID.BABY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.VARIANT_LIQUID.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A chonky little Sponge Sluglet.\n"
"\n"
"In time it will mature into a fully grown <link=\"STATERPILLAR\">Sponge Slug</link>."
msgstr ""
"Uma pequena Lesma Esponja rechonchuda.\n"
"\n"
"Com o tempo, ela amadurecerá e se tornará uma <link=\"STATERPILLAR\">Lesma Esponja</link> totalmente crescida."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.VARIANT_LIQUID.BABY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.VARIANT_LIQUID.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"STATERPILLAR\">Sponge Sluglet</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"STATERPILLAR\">Lesminha Esponja</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.VARIANT_LIQUID.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.VARIANT_LIQUID.DESC"
msgid ""
"Sponge Slugs are thirsty creatures that soak up <link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">Liquids</link> during the day.\n"
"\n"
"They deposit their stored <link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">Liquids</link> into the exposed <link=\"LIQUIDCONDUIT\">Liquid Pipes</"
"link> they sleep next to at night."
msgstr ""
"Lesmas Esponja são criaturas sedentas que absorvem <link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">Líquidos</link> durante o dia.\n"
"\n"
"Elas depositam seus <link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">Líquidos</link> armazenados nos <link=\"LIQUIDCONDUIT\">Canos</link> expostos "
"ao lado dos quais dormem à noite."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.VARIANT_LIQUID.EGG_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.VARIANT_LIQUID.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"STATERPILLAR\">Sponge Slug Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"STATERPILLAR\">Ovo de Lesma Esponja</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.VARIANT_LIQUID.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STATERPILLAR.VARIANT_LIQUID.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"STATERPILLAR\">Sponge Slug</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"STATERPILLAR\">Lesma Esponja</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STEAMSPOUT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STEAMSPOUT.DESC"
msgid "A rocky vent that spouts <link=\"STEAM\">Steam</link>."
msgstr "Uma abertura rochosa que jorra <link=\"STEAM\">Vapor</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STEAMSPOUT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STEAMSPOUT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GEYSERS\">Steam Spout</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GEYSERS\">Fonte de Vapor</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STEGO.BABY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STEGO.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A heavy-footed little Lumb baby.\n"
"\n"
"In time, it will grow into a stompy <link=\"STEGO\">Lumb</link>."
msgstr ""
"Um pequeno Esteguinho de passos pesados.\n"
"\n"
"Com o tempo, ele crescerá e se tornará um <link=\"STEGO\">Estegum</link> pisoteador."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STEGO.BABY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STEGO.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"STEGO\">Lumblet</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"STEGO\">Esteguinho</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STEGO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STEGO.DESC"
msgid ""
"Lumbs are non-hostile critters that subsist on <link=\"VINEMOTHER\">Ovagro</link> vines.\n"
"\n"
"When they stomp heavily near <link=\"PLANTS\">plants</link>, the commotion causes harvestable items to fall to the ground."
msgstr ""
"Esteguns são criaturas não hostis que se alimentam das vinhas de <link=\"VINEMOTHER\">Ovagro</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Quando pisoteiam com força perto de <link=\"PLANTS\">plantas</link>, a agitação faz com que itens colhíveis caiam no chão."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STEGO.EGG_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STEGO.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"STEGO\">Lumb Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"STEGO\">Ovo de Estegum</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STEGO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.STEGO.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"STEGO\">Lumb</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"STEGO\">Estegum</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SUPERWORMPLANT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SUPERWORMPLANT.DESC"
msgid ""
"A Grubfruit Plant that has flourished after being tended by a <link=\"DIVERGENTSPECIES\">Divergent</link> critter.\n"
"\n"
"It will produce high quality <link=\"WORMSUPERFRUIT\">Grubfruits</link>."
msgstr ""
"Uma Planta de Hortífruta que floresceu após ser cuidada por uma criatura <link=\"DIVERGENTSPECIES\">Divergente</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Ela produzirá <link=\"WORMSUPERFRUIT\">Hortífrutas</link> de alta qualidade."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SUPERWORMPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SUPERWORMPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant produces edible <link=\"WORMSUPERFRUIT\">Grubfruit</link>."
msgstr "Esta planta produz <link=\"WORMSUPERFRUIT\">Hortífruta</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SUPERWORMPLANT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SUPERWORMPLANT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"WORMPLANT\">Grubfruit Plant</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"WORMPLANT\">Hortífruta</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SWAMPFORAGEPLANTPLANTED.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SWAMPFORAGEPLANTPLANTED.DESC"
msgid ""
"Swamp Chards are incapable of propagating but can be harvested for a single low quality and calorie dense "
"<link=\"FOOD\">Food</link> serving."
msgstr ""
"Acelgas do Pântano são incapazes de se propagar, mas podem ser colhidas para uma única porção de <link=\"FOOD\">Alimento</"
"link> de baixa qualidade e com alta densidade calórica."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SWAMPFORAGEPLANTPLANTED.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SWAMPFORAGEPLANTPLANTED.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SWAMPFORAGEPLANTPLANTED\">Swamp Chard</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SWAMPFORAGEPLANTPLANTED\">Acelga do Pântano</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SWAMPHARVESTPLANT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SWAMPHARVESTPLANT.DESC"
msgid "Bog Buckets produce juicy, sweet <link=\"SWAMPFRUIT\">Bog Jellies</link> for <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link>."
msgstr ""
"Baldes do Brejo produzem <link=\"SWAMPFRUIT\">Geleias do Brejo</link> suculentas e doces para <link=\"FOOD\">Alimento</"
"link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SWAMPHARVESTPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SWAMPHARVESTPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant produces edible <link=\"SWAMPFRUIT\">Bog Jellies</link>."
msgstr "Esta planta produz <link=\"SWAMPFRUIT\">Geleias do Brejo</link> comestíveis."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SWAMPHARVESTPLANT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SWAMPHARVESTPLANT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SWAMPHARVESTPLANT\">Bog Bucket</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SWAMPHARVESTPLANT\">Baldes do Brejo</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SWAMPLILY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SWAMPLILY.DESC"
msgid "Balm Lilies produce <link=\"SWAMPLILYFLOWER\">Balm Lily Flower</link>, a lovely bloom with medicinal properties."
msgstr ""
"Lírios Balsâmicos produzem <link=\"SWAMPLILYFLOWER\">Flor de Lírio Balsâmico</link>, uma bela flor com propriedades "
"medicinais."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SWAMPLILY.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SWAMPLILY.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant produces medicinal <link=\"SWAMPLILYFLOWER\">Balm Lily Flower</link>."
msgstr "Esta planta produz <link=\"SWAMPLILYFLOWER\">Flor de Lírio Balsâmico</link> medicinal."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SWAMPLILY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.SWAMPLILY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SWAMPLILY\">Balm Lily</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SWAMPLILY\">Lírio Bálsamo</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.TOEPLANT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.TOEPLANT.DESC"
msgid "Tranquil Toes improve <link=\"DECOR\">Decor</link> by giving their surroundings the visual equivalent of a foot rub."
msgstr ""
"Raízes Serenas melhoram a <link=\"DECOR\">Decor</link> ao dar aos seus arredores o equivalente visual de uma massagem nos "
"pés."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.TOEPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.TOEPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant improves ambient <link=\"DECOR\">Decor</link>."
msgstr "Esta planta melhora a <link=\"DECOR\">Decoração</link> do ambiente."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.TOEPLANT.GROWTH_BONUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.TOEPLANT.GROWTH_BONUS"
msgid "Growth Bonus"
msgstr "Bônus de Crescimento"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.TOEPLANT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.TOEPLANT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"TOEPLANT\">Tranquil Toes</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"TOEPLANT\">Raízes Serenas</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.TOEPLANT.WILT_PENALTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.TOEPLANT.WILT_PENALTY"
msgid "Wilt Penalty"
msgstr "Penalidade por Murchar"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.TUBEWORM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.TUBEWORM.DESC"
msgid ""
"Tublias are aquatic organisms that sprout in <link=\"HEAT\">Hot</link> liquid environments.\n"
"\n"
"They can be harvested for <link=\"POLYPROPYLENE\">Plastic</link>."
msgstr ""
"As Tubélias são organismos aquáticos que brotam em ambientes líquidos <link=\"TEMPERATURE\">Quentes</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Podem ser colhidos para obter <link=\"POLYPROPYLENE\">Plástico</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.TUBEWORM.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.TUBEWORM.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This organism produces <link=\"POLYPROPYLENE\">Plastic</link>."
msgstr "Este organismo produz <link=\"POLYPROPYLENE\">Plástico</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.TUBEWORM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.TUBEWORM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"TUBEWORM\">Tublia</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"TUBEWORM\">Tubélia</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.URCHINPLANT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.URCHINPLANT.DESC"
msgid ""
"Pinpokets produce <link=\"URCHIN\">Pinpoki</link>, which can be processed into <link=\"URCHINMEAT\">Uni</link> or "
"<link=\"DIAMOND\">Diamond</link>."
msgstr ""
"As Ouriçeiras produzem <link=\"URCHIN\">Ouriço</link>, que podem ser processados em <link=\"URCHINMEAT\">Uni</link> ou "
"<link=\"DIAMOND\">Diamante</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.URCHINPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.URCHINPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This organism produces edible <link=\"URCHIN\">Pinpoki</link>."
msgstr "Este organismo produz <link=\"URCHIN\">Ouriço</link> comestível."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.URCHINPLANT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.URCHINPLANT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"URCHINPLANT\">Pinpoket</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"URCHINPLANT\">Ouriçeira</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.VINEBRANCH.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.VINEBRANCH.DESC"
msgid ""
"Ovagro Vines are plants that produce edible <link=\"VINEFRUIT\">Ovagro Fig</link>.\n"
"\n"
"If a vine is cut off from its <link=\"VINEMOTHER\">Ovagro Node</link>, it will perish."
msgstr ""
"Vinhas Ovágero são plantas que produzem o <link=\"VINEFRUIT\">Figo Ovágero</link> comestível.\n"
"\n"
"Se uma vinha for cortada de seu <link=\"VINEMOTHER\">Nó Ovágero</link>, ela perecerá."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.VINEBRANCH.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.VINEBRANCH.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"VINEMOTHER\">Ovagro Vine</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"VINEMOTHER\">Vinha Ovágero</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.VINEMOTHER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.VINEMOTHER.DESC"
msgid ""
"Ovagro Nodes are trellis plants that spread onto nearby available surfaces.\n"
"\n"
"A single <link=\"VINEMOTHER\">Ovagro Node</link> can support several <link=\"VINEMOTHER\">Ovagro Vines</link> without any "
"increase in its <link=\"WATER\">Water</link> requirements."
msgstr ""
"Nós Ovágero são plantas de treliça que se espalham pelas superfícies disponíveis próximas.\n"
"\n"
"Um único <link=\"VINEMOTHER\">Nó Ovágero</link> pode sustentar várias <link=\"VINEMOTHER\">Vinhas Ovágero</link> sem "
"qualquer aumento em suas necessidades de <link=\"WATER\">Água</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.VINEMOTHER.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.VINEMOTHER.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant produces <link=\"VINEFRUIT\">Ovagro Fig</link>."
msgstr "Esta planta produz <link=\"VINEFRUIT\">Figo Ovágero</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.VINEMOTHER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.VINEMOTHER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"VINEMOTHER\">Ovagro Node</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"VINEMOTHER\">Nó Ovágero</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WATERCUPS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WATERCUPS.DESC"
msgid ""
"Husha Cups are <link=\"DECOR\">Decorative</link> <link=\"PLANTS\">Plants</link> with a temper-cooling blue hue.\n"
"\n"
"Their presence provides a <link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link>-boosting \"cup half-full\" energy."
msgstr ""
"As Calíceas são <link=\"DECOR\">Plantas</link> <link=\"PLANTS\">Decorativas</link> com um tom azul refrescante.\n"
"\n"
"Sua presença proporciona uma energia de \"cálice meio cheio\" que eleva o <link=\"MORALE\">Moral</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WATERCUPS.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WATERCUPS.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant improves ambient <link=\"DECOR\">Decor</link>."
msgstr "Esta planta melhora a <link=\"DECOR\">Decor</link> do ambiente."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WATERCUPS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WATERCUPS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"WATERCUPS\">Husha Cups</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"WATERCUPS\">Calíceas</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WINECUPS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WINECUPS.DESC"
msgid ""
"Mellow Mallows heighten <link=\"DECOR\">Decor</link> and alleviate <link=\"STRESS\">Stress</link> with their calming color "
"and cradle shape."
msgstr ""
"Malvas Serenas aumentam a <link=\"DECOR\">Decor</link> e aliviam o <link=\"STRESS\">Estresse</link> com sua cor relaxante e "
"formato de berço."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WINECUPS.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WINECUPS.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant improves ambient <link=\"DECOR\">Decor</link>."
msgstr "Esta planta melhora a <link=\"DECOR\">Decoração</link> do ambiente."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WINECUPS.GROWTH_BONUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WINECUPS.GROWTH_BONUS"
msgid "Growth Bonus"
msgstr "Bônus de Crescimento"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WINECUPS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WINECUPS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"WINECUPS\">Mellow Mallow</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"WINECUPS\">Malva Serena</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WINECUPS.WILT_PENALTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WINECUPS.WILT_PENALTY"
msgid "Wilt Penalty"
msgstr "Penalidade por Murchar"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WOOD_TREE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WOOD_TREE.DESC"
msgid "Arbor Trees grow <link=\"FORESTTREE\">Arbor Tree Branches</link> and can be harvested for <link=\"WOOD\">Wood</link>."
msgstr "Os galhos da <link=\"FORESTTREE\">Árvore Arbórea</link> podem ser colhidos para obter <link=\"WOOD\">Madeira</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WOOD_TREE.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WOOD_TREE.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid ""
"This plant produces <link=\"FORESTTREE\">Arbor Tree Branches</link> that can be harvested for <link=\"WOOD\">Wood</link>."
msgstr ""
"Esta planta produz <link=\"FORESTTREE\">Galhos de Árvore Arbórea</link> que podem ser colhidos para obter "
"<link=\"WOOD\">madeira</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WOOD_TREE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WOOD_TREE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FORESTTREE\">Arbor Tree</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FORESTTREE\">Árvore Arbórea</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WOOD_TREE_BRANCH.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WOOD_TREE_BRANCH.DESC"
msgid "Arbor Trees Branches can be harvested for <link=\"WOOD\">Wood</link>."
msgstr "Galhos de Árvore Arbórea podem ser colhidos para obter <link=\"WOOD\">Madeira</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WOOD_TREE_BRANCH.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WOOD_TREE_BRANCH.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FORESTTREE\">Arbor Tree Branch</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FORESTTREE\">Galho de Árvore Arbórea</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WOODDEER.BABY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WOODDEER.BABY.DESC"
msgid ""
"A little yipping Flox Fawn.\n"
"\n"
"In time it will mature into a fully grown <link=\"WOODDEER\">Flox</link>."
msgstr ""
"Um pequeno Galhurdinho soltando gritinhos.\n"
"\n"
"Com o tempo, ele amadurecerá e se transformará em um <link=\"WOODDEER\">Galhúrdio</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WOODDEER.BABY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WOODDEER.BABY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"WOODDEER\">Flox Fawn</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"WOODDEER\">Galhurdinho</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WOODDEER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WOODDEER.DESC"
msgid ""
"Floxes are nonhostile critters that graze on <link=\"PRICKLEFLOWER\">Bristle Blossoms</link> and "
"<link=\"HARDSKINBERRY\">Pikeapples</link>.\n"
"\n"
"When Flox antlers are fully grown, they harden into shearable <link=\"WOOD\">Wood</link>."
msgstr ""
"Galhúrdios são criaturas inofensivas que pastam em <link=\"PRICKLEFLOWER\">Florescarpa</link> e "
"<link=\"HARDSKINBERRY\">Durifrutas</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Quando os chifres dos Galhúrdios atingem seu crescimento completo, eles endurecem e podem ser colhidos como "
"<link=\"WOOD\">Madeira</link>."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WOODDEER.EGG_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WOODDEER.EGG_NAME"
msgid "<link=\"WOODDEER\">Flox Egg</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"WOODDEER\">Ovo de Galhúrdio</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WOODDEER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WOODDEER.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"WOODDEER\">Flox</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"WOODDEER\">Galhúrdio</link>"

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WORMPLANT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WORMPLANT.DESC"
msgid ""
"Spindly Grubfruit Plants produce <link=\"WORMBASICFRUIT\">Spindly Grubfruit</link> for <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link>.\n"
"\n"
"If it is tended by a <link=\"DIVERGENTSPECIES\">Divergent</link> critter, it will produce high quality fruits instead."
msgstr ""
"Plantas de Hortífruta Seca produzem <link=\"WORMBASICFRUIT\">Hortífruta Seca</link> para <link=\"FOOD\">Alimento</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Se for cuidada por uma criatura <link=\"DIVERGENTSPECIES\">Divergente</link>, ela produzirá frutas de alta qualidade."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WORMPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WORMPLANT.DOMESTICATEDDESC"
msgid "This plant produces edible <link=\"WORMBASICFRUIT\">Spindly Grubfruit</link>."
msgstr "Esta planta produz <link=\"WORMBASICFRUIT\">Hortífruta Seca</link> comestível."

#. STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WORMPLANT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CREATURES.SPECIES.WORMPLANT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"WORMPLANT\">Spindly Grubfruit Plant</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"WORMPLANT\">Hortífruta Seca</link>"

