#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.SLEEPCLINICPAJAMAS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.SLEEPCLINICPAJAMAS.DESC"
msgid "A soft, fleecy ticket to dreamland."
msgstr "Uma passagem macia e fofa para a terra dos sonhos."

#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.SLEEPCLINICPAJAMAS.DESTROY_TOAST
msgctxt "STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.SLEEPCLINICPAJAMAS.DESTROY_TOAST"
