"Sweet discs made from <link=\"RAWEGG\">Raw Egg</link> and <link=\"COLDWHEATSEED\">Sleet Wheat Grain</link>.\n"
"\n"
"They're so thick!"
msgstr ""
"Deliciosas discos feitos de <link=\"RAWEGG\">Ovo Cru</link> e <link=\"COLDWHEATSEED\">Grão de Trigo Boreal</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Elas são tão espessas!"

