"\n"
"Dry rations have no expiry date."
msgstr ""
"Uma ração <link=\"SALSA\">Fruto Recheado</link> desidratada. Deve ser reidratada para ser considerada "
"<link=\"FOOD\">Comida</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Rações secas não têm data de validade."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALSA.DEHYDRATED.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALSA.DEHYDRATED.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SALSA\">Dried Stuffed Berry</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SALSA\">Fruta Desidratada Recheada</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALSA.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALSA.DESC"
msgid "A baked <link=\"PRICKLEFRUIT\">Bristle Berry</link> stuffed with delectable spices and vibrantly flavored."
msgstr "Um <link=\"PRICKLEFRUIT\">Fruto Escarpado</link> assado recheado com especiarias deliciosas e com sabor vibrante."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALSA.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALSA.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SALSA\">Stuffed Berry</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SALSA\">Fruto Recheado</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALSA.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALSA.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "A baked <link=\"PRICKLEFRUIT\">Bristle Berry</link> stuffed with delectable spices and vibrantly flavored."
msgstr "Um <link=\"PRICKLEFRUIT\">Fruto Escarpado</link> assado recheado com especiarias deliciosas e com sabor vibrante."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALTYSTICKSFOOD.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALTYSTICKSFOOD.DESC"
msgid ""
"An extremely salty snack harvested from a <link=\"SALTYSTICKSPLANT\">Sodicane</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Visiting a <link=\"WATERCOOLER\">Water Cooler</link> will counteract the <link=\"IDFOODEFFECTS\">Thirst</link> caused by "
"eating Salty Sticks."
msgstr ""
"Um petisco extremamente salgado colhido de uma <link=\"SALTYSTICKSPLANT\">Cana de Sal</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Visitar um <link=\"WATERCOOLER\">Bebedouro</link> combaterá a <link=\"IDFOODEFFECTS\">Sede</link> causada por comer Palitos "
"Salgados."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALTYSTICKSFOOD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SALTYSTICKSFOOD.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SALTYSTICKSFOOD\">Salty Sticks</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SALTYSTICKSFOOD\">Palitos Salgados</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SHELLFISHMEAT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SHELLFISHMEAT.DESC"
msgid "An uncooked chunk of very dead <link=\"CRABFRESHWATER\">Sanishell</link>. Yum!"
msgstr "Um pedaço cru de <link=\"CRABFRESHWATER\">Caranguejo Saneador</link> bem morto. Que delícia!"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SHELLFISHMEAT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SHELLFISHMEAT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SHELLFISHMEAT\">Raw Shellfish</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SHELLFISHMEAT\">Fruto do Mar Cru</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDDINOSAURMEAT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDDINOSAURMEAT.DESC"
msgid "A cooked stack of tough meat that's been marinated and slow-smoked to tender perfection."
msgstr "Uma porção cozida de carne dura que foi marinada e defumada lentamente até atingir a maciez perfeita."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDDINOSAURMEAT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDDINOSAURMEAT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SMOKEDDINOSAURMEAT\">Tender Brisket</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SMOKEDDINOSAURMEAT\">Peito Tenro</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDDINOSAURMEAT.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDDINOSAURMEAT.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "A stack of tender, slow-smoked meat."
msgstr "Uma porção de carne tenra, defumada lentamente."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDFISH.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDFISH.DESC"
msgid ""
"A buttery smoked fish fillet.\n"
"\n"
"It flakes nicely when pulled apart with a fork."
msgstr ""
"Um filé amanteigado de peixe defumado.\n"
"\n"
"Ele se desfaz facilmente ao ser separado com um garfo."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDFISH.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDFISH.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SMOKEDFISH\">Smoked Fish</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SMOKEDFISH\">Peixe Defumado</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDFISH.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDFISH.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "A buttery smoked fish fillet."
msgstr "Um filé amanteigado de peixe defumado."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDVEGETABLES.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDVEGETABLES.DESC"
msgid "Crisp vegetables stuffed with herbs and smoked for hours."
msgstr "Vegetais crocantes recheados com ervas e defumados por horas."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDVEGETABLES.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDVEGETABLES.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SMOKEDVEGETABLES\">Veggie Poppers</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SMOKEDVEGETABLES\">Vegetais Defumados</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDVEGETABLES.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SMOKEDVEGETABLES.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "Crisp vegetables stuffed with herbs."
msgstr "Vegetais crocantes recheados com ervas."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICEBREAD.DEHYDRATED.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICEBREAD.DEHYDRATED.DESC"
msgid ""
"A dehydrated <link=\"SPICEBREAD\">Pepper Bread</link> ration. It must be rehydrated in order to be considered "
"<link=\"FOOD\">Food</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Dry rations have no expiry date."
msgstr ""
"Uma ração desidratada de <link=\"SPICEBREAD\">Pão de Pimenta</link>. Deve ser reidratada para ser considerada "
"<link=\"FOOD\">Comida</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Rações secas não têm data de validade."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICEBREAD.DEHYDRATED.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICEBREAD.DEHYDRATED.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SPICEBREAD\">Dried Pepper Bread</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SPICEBREAD\">Pão Seco Apimentado</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICEBREAD.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICEBREAD.DESC"
msgid ""
"A loaf of bread, lightly spiced with <link=\"SPICENUT\">Pincha Peppernut</link> for a mild bite.\n"
"\n"
"There's a simple joy to be had in pulling it apart in one's fingers."
msgstr ""
"Um pão levemente temperado com <link=\"SPICENUT\">Pimenta Baga</link>, proporcionando uma mordida suave.\n"
"\n"
"Há uma simples alegria em despedaçar o pão com os dedos."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICEBREAD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICEBREAD.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SPICEBREAD\">Pepper Bread</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SPICEBREAD\">Pão Apimentado</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICEBREAD.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICEBREAD.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "A loaf of bread, lightly spiced with <link=\"SPICENUT\">Pincha Peppernut</link> for a mild bite."
msgstr "Um pão levemente temperado com <link=\"SPICENUT\">Pimenta Baga</link>, proporcionando uma mordida suave."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICENUT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICENUT.DESC"
msgid ""
"The flavorful nut of a <link=\"SPICEVINE\">Pincha Pepperplant</link>.\n"
"\n"
"The bitter outer rind hides a rich, peppery core that is useful in cooking."
msgstr ""
"Uma saborosa baga de <link=\"SPICEVINE\">Pimenteira Baga</link>.\n"
"\n"
"A casca amarga oculta um rico núcleo apimentado, ideal para o preparo de pratos."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICENUT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICENUT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SPICENUT\">Pincha Peppernut</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SPICENUT\">Pimenta Baga</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICYTOFU.DEHYDRATED.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICYTOFU.DEHYDRATED.DESC"
msgid ""
"A dehydrated <link=\"SPICYTOFU\">Spicy Tofu</link> ration. It must be rehydrated in order to be considered "
"<link=\"FOOD\">Food</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Dry rations have no expiry date."
msgstr ""
"Uma ração desidratada de <link=\"SPICYTOFU\">Tofu Apimentado</link>. Ela deve ser reidratada para ser considerada "
"<link=\"FOOD\">Comida</link>.\n"
"\n"
"As rações secas não têm data de validade."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICYTOFU.DEHYDRATED.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICYTOFU.DEHYDRATED.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SPICYTOFU\">Dried Spicy Tofu</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SPICYTOFU\">Tofu Desidratado Apimentado</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICYTOFU.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICYTOFU.DESC"
msgid ""
"<link=\"TOFU\">Tofu</link> marinated in a flavorful <link=\"SPICENUT\">Pincha Peppernut</link> sauce.\n"
"\n"
"It packs a delightful punch."
msgstr ""
"<link=\"TOFU\">Tofu</link> marinado em um saboroso molho de <link=\"SPICENUT\">Pimenta Baga</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Tem um sabor surpreendente e marcante."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICYTOFU.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICYTOFU.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SPICYTOFU\">Spicy Tofu</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SPICYTOFU\">Tofu Apimentado</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICYTOFU.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SPICYTOFU.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "<link=\"TOFU\">Tofu</link> marinated in a flavorful <link=\"SPICENUT\">Pincha Peppernut</link> sauce."
msgstr "<link=\"TOFU\">Tofu</link> marinado em um saboroso molho de <link=\"SPICENUT\">Pimenta Baga</link>."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SQUIDMEAT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SQUIDMEAT.DESC"
msgid ""
"Uncooked meat from a very dead <link=\"SQUID\">Glo Squid</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It's a little slippery."
msgstr ""
"Carne crua de um <link=\"SQUID\">Luluzente</link> muito morto.\n"
"\n"
"É um pouco escorregadia."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SQUIDMEAT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SQUIDMEAT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SQUIDMEAT\">Calamari</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SQUIDMEAT\">Calamari</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SQUIDMEAT.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SQUIDMEAT.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "Uncooked meat from a very dead <link=\"SQUID\">Glo Squid</link>."
msgstr "Carne crua de um <link=\"SQUID\">Luluzente</link> muito morto."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SURFANDTURF.DEHYDRATED.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SURFANDTURF.DEHYDRATED.DESC"
msgid ""
"A dehydrated <link=\"SURFANDTURF\">Surf'n'Turf</link> ration. It must be rehydrated in order to be considered "
"<link=\"FOOD\">Food</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Dry rations have no expiry date."
msgstr ""
"Uma porção desidratada de <link=\"SURFANDTURF\">Carnemarisco</link>. Precisa ser reidratada para ser considerada "
"<link=\"FOOD\">comida</link>.\n"
"\n"
"As rações secas não possuem data de validade."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SURFANDTURF.DEHYDRATED.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SURFANDTURF.DEHYDRATED.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SURFANDTURF\">Dried Surf'n'Turf</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SURFANDTURF\">Carnemarisco Desidratado</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SURFANDTURF.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SURFANDTURF.DESC"
msgid ""
"A bit of <link=\"MEAT\">Meat</link> from the land and <link=\"COOKEDFISH\">Cooked Seafood</link> from the sea.\n"
"\n"
"It's hearty and satisfying."
msgstr ""
"Um pouco de <link=\"MEAT\">Carne</link> e <link=\"COOKEDFISH\">Frutos do Mar Cozidos</link>.\n"
"\n"
"É substancioso e satisfatório."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SURFANDTURF.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SURFANDTURF.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SURFANDTURF\">Surf'n'Turf</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SURFANDTURF\">Carnemarisco</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SURFANDTURF.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SURFANDTURF.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "A bit of <link=\"MEAT\">Meat</link> from the land and <link=\"COOKEDFISH\">Cooked Seafood</link> from the sea."
msgstr "Um pouco de <link=\"MEAT\">Carne</link> e <link=\"COOKEDFISH\">Frutos do Mar Cozidos</link>."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SUSHI.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SUSHI.DESC"
msgid ""
"Raw <link=\"FISHMEAT\">Fish Fillet</link> wrapped with fresh <link=\"LETTUCE\">Lettuce</link>.\n"
"\n"
"While the salt of the lettuce may initially overpower the flavor, a keen palate can discern the subtle sweetness of the "
"fillet beneath."
msgstr ""
"Filé de <link=\"FISHMEAT\">Peixe</link> cru embrulhado em folhas frescas de <link=\"LETTUCE\">Alface</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Embora o sal da alface possa inicialmente sobrepujar o sabor, um paladar apurado pode discernir o leve dulçor do filé por "
"baixo."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SUSHI.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SUSHI.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SUSHI\">Sushi</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SUSHI\">Sushi</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SUSHI.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SUSHI.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "Raw <link=\"FISHMEAT\">Fish Fillet</link> wrapped with fresh <link=\"LETTUCE\">Lettuce</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"FISHMEAT\">Filé de Peixe</link> cru envolto em <link=\"LETTUCE\">Alface</link> fresca."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SWAMPDELIGHTS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SWAMPDELIGHTS.DESC"
msgid ""
"Dried gelatinous cubes from a <link=\"SWAMPFRUIT\">Bog Jelly</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Each cube has a wonderfully chewy texture and is lightly coated in a delicate powder."
msgstr ""
"Cubos gelatinosos secos de uma <link=\"SWAMPFRUIT\">Geleia do Pântano</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Cada cubo tem uma textura maravilhosamente mastigável e é levemente revestido com um pó delicado."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SWAMPDELIGHTS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SWAMPDELIGHTS.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SWAMPDELIGHTS\">Swampy Delights</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SWAMPDELIGHTS\">Delícias do Pântano</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SWAMPDELIGHTS.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SWAMPDELIGHTS.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "Dried gelatinous cubes from a <link=\"SWAMPFRUIT\">Bog Jelly</link>."
msgstr "Cubos gelatinosos secos de uma <link=\"SWAMPFRUIT\">Geleia do Pântano</link>."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SWAMPFORAGEPLANT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SWAMPFORAGEPLANT.DESC"
msgid ""
"A seedless plant with a squishy, juicy center and an awful smell.\n"
"\n"
"It cannot be replanted."
msgstr ""
"Uma planta sem sementes com um centro mole e suculento e um cheiro horrível.\n"
"\n"
"Não pode ser replantada."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SWAMPFORAGEPLANT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SWAMPFORAGEPLANT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SWAMPFORAGEPLANT\">Swamp Chard Heart</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SWAMPFORAGEPLANT\">Acelga do Pântano</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SWAMPFRUIT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SWAMPFRUIT.DESC"
msgid "A fruit with an outer film that contains chewy gelatinous cubes."
msgstr "Uma fruta com uma película externa que contém cubos gelatinosos e mastigáveis."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SWAMPFRUIT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.SWAMPFRUIT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"SWAMPFRUIT\">Bog Jelly</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"SWAMPFRUIT\">Geleia do Pântano</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.TOFU.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.TOFU.DESC"
msgid ""
"A bland curd made from <link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">Nosh Beans</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It has an unusual but pleasant consistency."
msgstr ""
"Uma coalhada sem sabor feita de <link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">Grão de Brotossoja</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Possui uma consistência incomum, mas agradável."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.TOFU.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.TOFU.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"TOFU\">Tofu</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"TOFU\">Tofu</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.TOFU.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.TOFU.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "A bland curd made from <link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">Nosh Beans</link>."
msgstr "Uma coalhada sem sabor feita de <link=\"BEANPLANTSEED\">Grão de Brotossoja</link>."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.URCHINMEAT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.URCHINMEAT.DESC"
msgid ""
"The edible flesh of a <link=\"URCHIN\">Pinpoki</link>.\n"
"\n"
"A rare delicacy whose safe preparation involves destroying the valuable outer spikes."
msgstr ""
"A carne comestível de um <link=\"URCHIN\">Ouriço</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Uma iguaria rara cujo preparo seguro envolve destruir os valiosos espinhos externos."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.URCHINMEAT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.URCHINMEAT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"URCHINMEAT\">Uni</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"URCHINMEAT\">Uni</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.URCHINMEAT.RECIPEDESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.URCHINMEAT.RECIPEDESC"
msgid "The edible flesh of a <link=\"URCHIN\">Pinpoki</link> prepared at the <link=\"SUSHIBAR\">Sushi Bar</link>."
msgstr "A carne comestível de um <link=\"URCHIN\">Ouriço</link> preparada no <link=\"SUSHIBAR\">Bar de Sushi</link>."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.VINEFRUIT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.VINEFRUIT.DESC"
msgid ""
"The fruit from an <link=\"VINEMOTHER\">Ovagro Vine</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It's fun to squeeze as many as possible into a single mouthful."
msgstr ""
"Esses frutos vêm de uma <link=\"VINEMOTHER\">Vinha Ovágero</link>.\n"
"\n"
"É divertido espremer o máximo possível em uma única mordida."

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.VINEFRUIT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.VINEFRUIT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"VINEFRUIT\">Ovagro Fig</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"VINEFRUIT\">Figo Ovágero</link>"

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.VINEFRUITJAM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.VINEFRUITJAM.DESC"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.VINEFRUITJAM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.FOOD.VINEFRUITJAM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"VINEFRUITJAM\"></link>"
msgstr "<link=\"VINEFRUITJAM\"></link>"

