msgid ""
"A disposable <link=\"ELECTROBANK\">Power Bank</link> made with <link=\"URANIUMORE\">Uranium Ore</link>.\n"
"\n"
"It can power buildings via <link=\"LARGEELECTROBANKDISCHARGER\">Large Dischargers</link> or "
