"Organic materials are useful ingredients gathered from the environment, harvested from <link=\"PLANTS\">plants</link> or "
"derived from <link=\"CREATURES\">critters</link>.\n"
"\n"
"Some, not all, require additional processing before they can be used."
msgstr ""
"Materiais orgânicos são ingredientes úteis coletados do ambiente, colhidos de <link=\"PLANTS\">plantas</link> ou derivados "
"de <link=\"CREATURES\">criaturas</link>.\n"
