msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.USERMENUACTIONS.READLORE.SEARCH_TECHNOLOGY_SUCCESS.SEARCH2"
msgid ""
"I see if I can salvage anything from the electronics. I add what I find to my database.\n"
"\n"
"New Database Entry discovered."
